From 8a125dc1f64d109e495ccf6ea767e1c032941291 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MikolajQ <mikolaj.q@wp.pl>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 21:05:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Add Wi-Fi and Bluetooth options to modes

Airplane mode does not reliably turn Wi-Fi and Bluetooth off: Android
remembers whether the user last kept them on in airplane mode, so a
bedtime mode with airplane mode may leave Wi-Fi on one night and off
the next.

Next to the airplane mode option, a mode's display settings page gets
switches that turn Wi-Fi and Bluetooth off while the mode is on, stored
as the disable Wi-Fi and disable Bluetooth extra effects. They work with
or without airplane mode, and are listed in the summary of the page.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: Idf194af78783d989b7d725943365b2550b900f93
